<title>USA: Aftermarket Technology acquires Trans Mart.</title>
<headline>Aftermarket Technology acquires Trans Mart.</headline>
<dateline>WESTMONT, Ill. 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aftermarket Technology Corp said Monday it has acquired Trans Mart Inc, a distributor of automatic and standard transmission parts, for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>The acquisition was financed with Aftermarket Technology's revolving credit facility.</p>
<p>Trans Mart has annual sales of $37 million and more than 175 employees.</p>
<p>-- ((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
